                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c4a0b6cc-4921-338d-bdad-e0c4998efd0a",
                        "entry_id": "8f6d3613-40c2-3e13-8dff-572fde60060d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een slimme, handige of listige manier om je doel te bereiken"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "efc8ed3f-7562-4b4e-b854-bde798135ac9",
                                "sense_id": "c4a0b6cc-4921-338d-bdad-e0c4998efd0a",
                                "text": "Lidl is niet, zoals Jumbo en Albert Heijn, overgestapt naar een ander kippenras met dieren die langzamer groeien. Met kunstgrepen zorgt de Duitse discountsupermarkt alleen dat de dieren van het 'plofkipras' iets minder snel worden vetgemest."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "17122dcb-8229-40b7-b6de-c55d827a6221",
                                "sense_id": "c4a0b6cc-4921-338d-bdad-e0c4998efd0a",
                                "text": "The Day Will Come overtuigt wel vaker niet. Dat Lillian (Sofie Gråbøl), de enige sympathieke onderwijzer op de school, zich nauwelijks verzet tegen Hecks regime, valt enigszins te begrijpen: ze wil haar baan immers niet kwijt. Maar als ze na haar ontslag nog steeds niet naar de onderwijsinspectie of de politie stapt, voelt dat als een kunstgreep. Kunnen alle verschrikkingen tenminste nog wat langer voortduren en is de wraak uiteindelijk nóg zoeter, lijken de makers te hebben gedacht."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0bfd0871-6431-404d-8452-bbcdd3224ea8",
                        "source_entry_id": "8f6d3613-40c2-3e13-8dff-572fde60060d",
                        "source_sense_id": "c4a0b6cc-4921-338d-bdad-e0c4998efd0a",
                        "source_sense_description": "een slimme, handige of listige manier om je doel te bereiken",
                        "target_lang_word": "trick",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "trick",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d457365-cadd-364e-95dc-17a01cfdf08b",
                                        "entry_id": "95d2bb20-9454-31e5-83ae-c5c6d7adea0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something designed to fool, dupe, outsmart, mislead or swindle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b76a362-7111-45a9-b8da-06ed711cb7c9",
                                                "sense_id": "4d457365-cadd-364e-95dc-17a01cfdf08b",
                                                "text": "It was just a trick to say that the house was underpriced."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eea2f651-ae49-4b04-9387-03e124be4913",
                                                "sense_id": "4d457365-cadd-364e-95dc-17a01cfdf08b",
                                                "text": "He played a trick on his sister as April Fool's Day."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f4886a6d-1485-3ad7-93a7-acbfd7c263b9",
                                        "entry_id": "95d2bb20-9454-31e5-83ae-c5c6d7adea0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A single element of a magician's (or any variety entertainer's) act; a magic trick."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a9672e9-f901-4392-ab05-eaaf08164a0e",
                                                "sense_id": "f4886a6d-1485-3ad7-93a7-acbfd7c263b9",
                                                "text": "And for my next trick, I will pull a wombat out of a duffel bag."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "569d3386-eeb3-39b4-a07c-1844fbafa9c8",
                                        "entry_id": "95d2bb20-9454-31e5-83ae-c5c6d7adea0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An entertaining difficult physical action."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f843fcb7-242e-40c5-96df-92a152762da0",
                                                "sense_id": "569d3386-eeb3-39b4-a07c-1844fbafa9c8",
                                                "text": "That's a nice skateboard, but can you do any tricks on it?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eaea054f-e4e1-4973-ad24-13a9391891ec",
                                                "sense_id": "569d3386-eeb3-39b4-a07c-1844fbafa9c8",
                                                "text": "Yo-yo tricks involving sleeping the yo-yo (like \"walking the dog\" and \"rocking the baby\") cannot be performed in space."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "70e19705-8729-3e15-aad4-27ef445ca82e",
                                        "entry_id": "95d2bb20-9454-31e5-83ae-c5c6d7adea0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An effective, clever or quick way of doing something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f81114b-a33e-494a-b5b5-08ace292cfac",
                                                "sense_id": "70e19705-8729-3e15-aad4-27ef445ca82e",
                                                "text": "tricks of the trade; what's the trick of getting this chair to fold up?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68d48356-cf8d-416b-87d4-83d78ee08eb9",
                                                "sense_id": "70e19705-8729-3e15-aad4-27ef445ca82e",
                                                "text": "Plastics are energy-rich substances, which is why many of them burn so readily. Any organism that could unlock and use that energy would do well in the Anthropocene. Terrestrial bacteria and fungi which can manage this trick are already familiar to experts in the field."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "523a3c12-1b16-3a67-b87e-e581a88b3c3c",
                                        "entry_id": "95d2bb20-9454-31e5-83ae-c5c6d7adea0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mischievous or annoying behavior; a prank."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ed8b45b-8555-46df-a2a5-81a294defbb0",
                                                "sense_id": "523a3c12-1b16-3a67-b87e-e581a88b3c3c",
                                                "text": "the tricks of boys"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d42f4fb1-3f75-4e78-a156-eea5385b6a24",
                                                "sense_id": "523a3c12-1b16-3a67-b87e-e581a88b3c3c",
                                                "text": "They played a crude trick on the teacher."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e0e8e8d-44f3-395f-b06e-f28fa5ee9d68",
                                        "entry_id": "95d2bb20-9454-31e5-83ae-c5c6d7adea0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A particular habit or manner; a peculiarity; a trait."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4b25714-6139-4483-923b-e0a0c70c4573",
                                                "sense_id": "4e0e8e8d-44f3-395f-b06e-f28fa5ee9d68",
                                                "text": "a trick of drumming with the fingers; a trick of frowning"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a9bb89e-21e0-4f0e-863f-d6fa8ab28bc2",
                                                "sense_id": "4e0e8e8d-44f3-395f-b06e-f28fa5ee9d68",
                                                "text": "He hath a trick of Cœur de Lion's face."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f79069ee-952c-4b71-970e-a555b2c18015",
                                                "sense_id": "4e0e8e8d-44f3-395f-b06e-f28fa5ee9d68",
                                                "text": "The trick of that voice I do well remember."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ffc45cc-4b9c-3496-a2b8-156bc13c447b",
                                        "entry_id": "95d2bb20-9454-31e5-83ae-c5c6d7adea0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A knot, braid, or plait of hair."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8f578e6-ab26-4a48-8f00-e11d8b824b6a",
                                                "sense_id": "1ffc45cc-4b9c-3496-a2b8-156bc13c447b",
                                                "text": "I cannot tell , but it stirs me more than all your court curls , or your spangles , or your tricks"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6cac98eb-63cd-3c03-b17b-933d8e894ecf",
                                        "entry_id": "95d2bb20-9454-31e5-83ae-c5c6d7adea0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sequence in which each player plays a card and a winning play is determined."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed6df24c-8f70-4969-8dfb-47a7bc8ea374",
                                                "sense_id": "6cac98eb-63cd-3c03-b17b-933d8e894ecf",
                                                "text": "I was able to take the second trick with the queen of hearts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a55d74ef-6d9e-4e56-9a35-335959593b94",
                                                "sense_id": "6cac98eb-63cd-3c03-b17b-933d8e894ecf",
                                                "text": "And now (as oft in some distemper'd state) / On one nice trick depends the gen'ral fate!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9e0d3eed-bec4-3908-b6b3-f027fd007340",
                                        "entry_id": "95d2bb20-9454-31e5-83ae-c5c6d7adea0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sex act, chiefly one performed for payment; an act of prostitution."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67c777b0-2936-4c3d-84da-280812b2fcd0",
                                                "sense_id": "9e0d3eed-bec4-3908-b6b3-f027fd007340",
                                                "text": "turn a trick"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9aebe27b-6a95-469b-bf23-cc1984c31a36",
                                                "sense_id": "9e0d3eed-bec4-3908-b6b3-f027fd007340",
                                                "text": "turn tricks"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6c39bfa-401d-48dc-9fdf-d6e106b74774",
                                                "sense_id": "9e0d3eed-bec4-3908-b6b3-f027fd007340",
                                                "text": "Across 110th street / Woman trying to catch a trick on the street, ooh baby / Across 110th Street / You can find it all in the street"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "131b057b-7ff4-49f7-996a-618a99e41a83",
                                                "sense_id": "9e0d3eed-bec4-3908-b6b3-f027fd007340",
                                                "text": "I see your teeth flash, Jamaican honey so sweet\nDown where Lexington cross 47th Street.\nOh, she's a big girl, she's standing six-foot three,\nTurning tricks for the dudes in the big city."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "900f1fa4-586f-4b78-8d1e-20ffa0074cf1",
                                                "sense_id": "9e0d3eed-bec4-3908-b6b3-f027fd007340",
                                                "text": "Perhaps the most important thing a prostitute learns is how to \"manage\" the client; how to con him into spending more money than he planned. Learning how to perform tricks takes only a few minutes. Learning how to \"hustle\" the client takes longer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e5b7a13-2636-4ca6-8793-219d2054e5cf",
                                                "sense_id": "9e0d3eed-bec4-3908-b6b3-f027fd007340",
                                                "text": "\"How did you get into all this?\" \"I started doing tricks when I was young and I don't mean the magic circle. I learned about sex from an early age. There was nothing else to do in Pitsea except heavy petting and getting F grades at school.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "480dc4c5-4b7f-4569-929e-d4b94e7587cf",
                                                "sense_id": "9e0d3eed-bec4-3908-b6b3-f027fd007340",
                                                "text": "When he later asked her to strip and perform tricks for him, she refused, and he chased her away. She had similar experiences with other men until she eventually fell into prostitution: […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ee87916a-eafd-3a87-92fe-2ca9a4c6a176",
                                        "entry_id": "95d2bb20-9454-31e5-83ae-c5c6d7adea0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A customer or client of a prostitute."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7139e30-9f41-47bb-b560-9fb7d8fc3874",
                                                "sense_id": "ee87916a-eafd-3a87-92fe-2ca9a4c6a176",
                                                "text": "As the businessman rounded the corner, she thought, \"Here comes another trick.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5678c72c-5390-4c7d-8990-ea4540ccdbd0",
                                                "sense_id": "ee87916a-eafd-3a87-92fe-2ca9a4c6a176",
                                                "text": "Ten minutes after she got down she broke luck. A white trick in a thirty-seven Buick picked her up. I timed her. She had racehorse speed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df08ef23-481d-3406-a05f-c2c9cdb9d2c9",
                                        "entry_id": "95d2bb20-9454-31e5-83ae-c5c6d7adea0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A term of abuse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang",
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d944abe8-e2f5-3d33-9fca-4bd10ccef5b0",
                                        "entry_id": "95d2bb20-9454-31e5-83ae-c5c6d7adea0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A daily period of work, especially in shift-based jobs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Pennsylvania",
                                            "Western"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "937eb5e8-ae1d-464f-ae2f-13d6a4722a3f",
                                                "sense_id": "d944abe8-e2f5-3d33-9fca-4bd10ccef5b0",
                                                "text": "On third trick from 12 m. to 8 am, we have W. A. White, formerly operator at Wallula, who thus far has given general satisfaction."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a977126-5d5b-43f9-8a4f-2b17498ccbc4",
                                                "sense_id": "d944abe8-e2f5-3d33-9fca-4bd10ccef5b0",
                                                "text": "Woodside Junction—On 8 hour basis, first trick $60, second trick $60, third trick $50."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad9a0329-3dcb-4206-97a4-b2a4ef6dc4fc",
                                                "sense_id": "d944abe8-e2f5-3d33-9fca-4bd10ccef5b0",
                                                "text": "The Union contends that Fifer was entitled to promotion to the position of Group Leader on the third trick in the Core Room Department."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a613a60d-41a9-31be-b941-37eaac2616c9",
                                        "entry_id": "95d2bb20-9454-31e5-83ae-c5c6d7adea0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sailor's spell of work at the helm, usually two hours long."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c30e4e5-c34d-46d9-bd06-bf32a74710b4",
                                                "sense_id": "a613a60d-41a9-31be-b941-37eaac2616c9",
                                                "text": "I must go down to the seas again, to the vagrant gypsy life,\nTo the gull's way and the whale's way, where the wind's like a whetted knife;\nAnd all I ask is a merry yarn from a laughing fellow-rover,\nAnd quiet sleep and a sweet dream when the long trick's over."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d26359ff-70d2-3168-bf28-9f5a7cda76cb",
                                        "entry_id": "95d2bb20-9454-31e5-83ae-c5c6d7adea0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A toy; a trifle; a plaything."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd7fa136-ed28-4347-ad49-6719558d56fa",
                                                "sense_id": "d26359ff-70d2-3168-bf28-9f5a7cda76cb",
                                                "text": "The vviles and guiles that vvomen vvorke, / Diſſembled vvith an outvvard ſhevv: / The tricks and toyes that in them lurke, / The Cock that treads thẽ [them] ſhall not knovv, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4171f63-4971-32b1-baa6-d2998a620e3f",
                                        "entry_id": "95d2bb20-9454-31e5-83ae-c5c6d7adea0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A representation of arms that is drawn as an outline with labels to indicate colors."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95073f9c-4e97-4dc0-86e7-c1ddf8ff4791",
                                                "sense_id": "a4171f63-4971-32b1-baa6-d2998a620e3f",
                                                "text": "Heraldic Collections of various Heralds and others, containing Arms blazoned and in trick, grants of arms, pedigrees, etc."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79a17c1a-4935-46d6-b8a3-5cb8472547fe",
                                                "sense_id": "a4171f63-4971-32b1-baa6-d2998a620e3f",
                                                "text": "The trick […] might be meant for a lion passant or for one rampant embelif […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "trick",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "89fbe750-cf03-3c6a-9552-4b2e6e561851",
                                        "entry_id": "4b0840a5-f3c2-37fe-af0f-2f5c3d988659",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To fool; to cause to believe something untrue; to deceive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8600da10-ea4c-4041-ac7d-eb951a541092",
                                                "sense_id": "89fbe750-cf03-3c6a-9552-4b2e6e561851",
                                                "text": "You tried to trick me when you said that house was underpriced."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b02feb3c-388f-4edc-87f4-330e0bce0f32",
                                                "sense_id": "89fbe750-cf03-3c6a-9552-4b2e6e561851",
                                                "text": "I was once tricked into believing I had left my phone in the locker."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "099fbb28-7faf-33da-b12f-d4220cb7cc5a",
                                        "entry_id": "4b0840a5-f3c2-37fe-af0f-2f5c3d988659",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To draw (as contrasted with to blazon, which is to describe in words)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9449c8b8-f44a-4b27-aaeb-7b59bb46e371",
                                                "sense_id": "099fbb28-7faf-33da-b12f-d4220cb7cc5a",
                                                "text": "The rugged Pyrrhus, he whose sable arms, / Black as his purpose, did the night resemble / When he lay couched in the ominous horse, / Hath now this dread and black complexion smear'd / With heraldry more dismal; head to foot / Now is he total gules; horridly trick'd / With blood of fathers, mothers, daughters, sons […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c90ce3d9-ad1d-4e27-8ec2-70c4ef53bcd4",
                                                "sense_id": "099fbb28-7faf-33da-b12f-d4220cb7cc5a",
                                                "text": "They forget that they are in the statutes: […] there they are trick'd, they and their pedigrees."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e321a64-092f-3a35-b553-ff011564fd1c",
                                        "entry_id": "4b0840a5-f3c2-37fe-af0f-2f5c3d988659",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To dress; to decorate; to adorn fantastically; often followed by up, off, or out."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3efa93a7-b15c-4cf2-ac2a-4722afb8a7fe",
                                                "sense_id": "4e321a64-092f-3a35-b553-ff011564fd1c",
                                                "text": "[T]his Pillar [the \"Compounded Order\"] is nothing in effect, but a Medlie, or an Amaſſe of all the precedent Ornaments, making a nevv kinde, by ſtealth, and though the moſt richly tricked, yet the pooreſt in this, that he is a borrovver of all his Beautie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70300575-5f1b-4d01-a30d-63ae5a92ec32",
                                                "sense_id": "4e321a64-092f-3a35-b553-ff011564fd1c",
                                                "text": "Tricking up their children in fine clothes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b09e8f3a-a7cb-405b-982c-a7d9c760dd69",
                                                "sense_id": "4e321a64-092f-3a35-b553-ff011564fd1c",
                                                "text": "Trick her off in air."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "592ec9e2-f476-4f44-89d8-c152ef3bf7c0",
                                                "sense_id": "4e321a64-092f-3a35-b553-ff011564fd1c",
                                                "text": "They are simple, but majestic, records of the feelings of the poet; as little tricked out for the public eye as his diary would have been."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e5a43c27-7d0b-3a39-82cb-dbfad2f1dc4e",
                                        "entry_id": "4b0840a5-f3c2-37fe-af0f-2f5c3d988659",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To engage in prostitution or casual sex."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7fe3251-89ed-4151-b3bd-ea67f69cc68a",
                                                "sense_id": "e5a43c27-7d0b-3a39-82cb-dbfad2f1dc4e",
                                                "text": "1977-1980, Lou Sullivan, personal diary, quoted in 2019, Ellis Martin, Zach Ozma (editors), We Both Laughed In Pleasure\n[…] and suddenly it was Maryellin, he & I in the bed. The guy was tall, lean & hard. Absolutely lovely body. For me, it was like my old tricking days."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51b03c1b-9fc3-48ba-bd4a-bf159458e4d7",
                                                "sense_id": "e5a43c27-7d0b-3a39-82cb-dbfad2f1dc4e",
                                                "text": "Asked whether one possible way for lesbians to increase sexual satisfaction within a relationship would be to \"trick\" outside it, Pearlman said that this could be a \"terrific turn-on\" if done right, but that she generally wouldn't recommend it because of the high risk of jealousy and breakups."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
